{"unit_id":"zhtx2024__dsh-pdf#card-zh","repo":"zhtx2024/dsh-pdf","commit":"38bfbc0dcd2eae0c3ad6a1d4340b91d01b04f8fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@zhtx2026/dsh-pdf 是面向 DSH 的 PDF 解析插件，提供给 agent 调用的 PDF 工具。它在宿主端注册 pdf_info、pdf_extract_text 和 pdf_render_page，并注入使用指引。用户可查看页数、页面尺寸、元数据和字体内嵌状态，按页提取文字及坐标，也能把页面渲染为 PNG；内嵌字体文件使用 pdfjs，未内嵌字体时切换系统字体渲染路径。适合整理 PDF 文档、读取中文原理图和查看页面图像。使用时提供本地 PDF 路径；无需 API Key 或外部账号，渲染结果写入本机文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-16","lib/index.js:21-24","lib/index.js:91-100","lib/index.js:157-167","lib/pdf-core.js:583-590","lib/pdf-core.js:771-784"]}
{"unit_id":"zhtx2024__dsh-pdf#card-en","repo":"zhtx2024/dsh-pdf","commit":"38bfbc0dcd2eae0c3ad6a1d4340b91d01b04f8fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@zhtx2026/dsh-pdf adds PDF tools to DSH: inspect page metadata and fonts, extract text with optional coordinates, or render a page to PNG. It chooses pdfjs or system fonts based on embedded fonts, helping read local PDFs and Chinese schematics. No API key is needed; PNGs are saved locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:15-16","lib/index.js:21-24","lib/index.js:91-100","lib/index.js:157-167","lib/pdf-core.js:583-590","lib/pdf-core.js:771-784"]}
